Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790103599999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": false, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790035199999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The strongest counterargument: the largest single directional move in the window is the opening 12-bar, ~36% bear leg to 1368.42, so the bull-trend label rests only on the last ~34 bars, and the 73 bars before that are balance, not trend.", "The 27 bars ahead of the final push are a two-sided range (2357.18-2680) with heavy overlap and mid-range closes; 2850 is a first-bar probe only 79.00 above 2771, and single-bar breakouts of multi-week range tops often fail and re-enter the range.", "Bar 1787270400000 (445.69 range, close 2515.30, ~255.70 upper tail) followed by a 27-bar stall is spike-high behavior consistent with a temporary exhaustion and a market capped by a range boundary rather than a functioning bull channel.", "The 208.30-point final bar after an extended advance could be a buy climax; a large bull bar that is immediately retraced would mark exhaustion rather than breakout acceptance."], "evidence_for": ["A 388.17-point bull trend bar (1787097600000) closed at 2252.16, 89% of its range and above the 73-bar range top 1974.46, with immediate follow-through to 2771 two bars later.", "Successive higher swing highs across the window (1974.46, 2293.80, 2771, 2850) and higher swing lows (1368.42, 1512.91, 2357.18/2358.62).", "The 27-bar pause held entirely above the breakout bar's open 1916.51 and the old range top 1974.46; no close returned inside the 73-bar range.", "The final bar closes 2775.61 above the prior spike high 2771 and in the upper 64% of its range, with four consecutive rising closes."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["The window opens at 2109.85 (close of 1779667200000) after a 2139.34 high, then declines 13 bars to 1368.42 (low of 1780704000000), about 36% below 2139.34.", "Bar 1780704000000 has a 230.85 range with a 200.13 lower tail and closes at 1568.55 (top ~13% of its range); bar 1780790400000 (open 1568.55, high 1690.78, low 1563.52, close 1687.83) is a bull reversal bar closing at its high.", "From 1780790400000 to 1787011200000 (73 bars) price overlaps repeatedly between 1512.91 (low of 1782432000000) and 1974.46 (high of 1785110400000); closes cluster 1550-1950 with many overlapping bodies and mixed closes (two-sided range).", "Bar 1787097600000 breaks out: open 1916.51, high 2293.80, low 1905.63, close 2252.16, a 388.17-point bull trend bar closing in the top ~11% of its range and above the 1974.46 range top.", "Bar 1787270400000 spikes to 2771 with a 445.69 range, closing 2515.30 and leaving a ~255.70 upper tail.", "Bars 1787184000000 through 1789603200000 (27 bars) stay between 2357.18 (low of 1788307200000) and 2680 (high of 1789084800000); bodies overlap and closes sit mostly 2380-2530.", "The last four closes are 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90, 2775.61; the final bar (open 2642.90, high 2850, low 2641.70, close 2775.61) closes above the prior spike high 2771 in the upper 64% of its 208.30-point range."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bear leg of 13 bars from the window high 2139.34 into the 1368.42 low of 1780704000000; bar ranges expand into the low and that bar closes 1568.55 with a 200.13 lower tail, followed by a bull reversal bar at 1687.83.", "end_time_ms": 1780790399999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1779667200000, "upper_boundary": "2139.34"}, {"description": "73-bar two-sided range from 1780790400000 to 1787011200000; repeated overlap between 1512.91 and 1974.46 with a slight upward tilt after the 1512.91 low, many inside bars and closes in the middle of the range.", "end_time_ms": 1787183999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull spike escaping the 73-bar range: bar 1787097600000 opens 1916.51 and closes 2252.16 above the 1974.46 range top, with follow-through to the 2771 spike high of 1787270400000.", "end_time_ms": 1787356799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Post-spike pause of 27 bars between the 2357.18 low of 1788307200000 and the 2680 high of 1789084800000; most highs sit 2520-2560 with probes to 2680 and most lows 2357-2440, heavy body overlap and mid-range closes.", "end_time_ms": 1789689599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787184000000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Final bull leg from the 2358.62 low of bar 1789430400000: 1789689600000 and 1789776000000 close 2612.02 and 2632.98, and 1789948800000 closes 2775.61 above the 2771 spike high. The breakout proper is bars 1789689600000-1789948800000.", "end_time_ms": 1790035199999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789689600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: several consecutive closes holding above 2700 (high of 1789776000000) and above 2771, with higher lows above 2641.70, would confirm acceptance above the spike high and strengthen the bull-trend/breakout-spike read.", "Failed breakout: a close back below 2641.70 (low of the final bar), followed by a close below 2568.16 (low of 1789862400000), would signal the breakout failed and shift the read back toward the 2357.18-2680 range.", "Range reassertion: a close back below 2357.18 with follow-through would turn the post-spike structure into a top and recast the 1787097600000 advance as a bull trap.", "Trend weakening: deeper pullbacks that overlap prior swing lows together with more bear bars closing near their lows would move the phase from breakout-spike toward channel or range.", "Climax risk: a further outsized bull bar immediately followed by a bear bar closing near its low would argue for a buy climax rather than a sustained second leg."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "high", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790092799999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["About 80 of the 120 bars are two-sided movement between 2358.62 and 2680.00, so the 22-bar bull leg can still be a breakout attempt inside a larger trading range rather than an established trend.", "Bar 112 covers 2658.06-2850.00 but closes 2723.15, i.e. 126.85 below its high - a large upper tail consistent with a buy climax - and bars 113-116 overlap without exceeding 2804.59.", "The pullback from 2850.00 to 2716.01 retraces roughly 37% of the 2486.12-2850.00 leg, and bar 117 (open 2738.87, close 2724.95) is a bear bar comparable in size to the preceding bull bars, showing two-sided trade at the highs.", "The earlier window highs were also made by spike bars that failed (bar 53 to 2680.00, bar 73 to 2609.02), each followed by sharp reversals, so the 2850.00 spike has precedent for failure."], "evidence_for": ["Bars 94-115 make a 22-bar bull leg from 2486.12 to 2850.00 with higher highs (2585.50, 2643.52, 2700.00, 2850.00) and a single pullback that held 2568.16 - trend structure rather than overlapping chop.", "Acceptance above the old range: the last 8 closes are all above the bar-53 high 2680.00, and no close has returned below bar 94's 2507.31 since the breakout.", "The prior bear leg into 2358.62 was fully retraced: bars 79-93 built a 2380-2500 base before the bull leg broke out of it instead of making a lower high.", "The last four bars hold above 2716.01 and close back near 2740, so the pullback has not reached the 2658.06-2680.00 breakout zone."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed H4 bars, 1788364800000 to 1790092799999; first print 2389.52, last close 2742.31 (+14.8% across the window).", "Bar 5 (open 2407.48) is a 104.8-point bull spike bar to 2509.15, closing 2506.79; bar 10 stalled at 2537.57 and bar 11 reversed to close 2450.96 after a 2436.73 low.", "Bars 12-52 form a wide overlap zone between 2411.04 (bar 47 low) and 2528.80 (bar 26 high); repeated pushes into 2520-2537 are retraced.", "Bar 53 spiked from 2457.12 to 2680.00 but closed 2555.52, leaving a 124.48 upper tail; bars 54-55 closed lower (2538.73, 2514.72).", "Bar 73 printed a higher high 2609.02 above bar 72's 2544.63 and closed 2514.07 near its low; bars 77-78 then broke down to the window low 2358.62.", "Bars 94-115 advanced from 2486.12 to 2850.00 with higher highs 2585.50 / 2643.52 / 2700.00 / 2850.00 and one pullback holding 2568.16 (bar 106).", "Bar 112 spans 2658.06-2850.00 and closes 2723.15, i.e. 126.85 below its high; the last 4 bars overlap inside 2716.01 (bar 117 low) - 2804.59 (bar 115 high).", "Last 8 closes (2723.15, 2754.31, 2760.51, 2775.61, 2738.87, 2724.95, 2740.20, 2742.31) are all above the prior range top 2680.00."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bars 12-52: about 41 overlapping H4 bars chopping between 2411.04 and 2528.80 after bar 11's bear reversal; pushes to 2520-2537 fail and each leg is retraced (two-sided congestion).", "end_time_ms": 1789127999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2411.04", "start_time_ms": 1788537600000, "upper_boundary": "2528.80"}, {"description": "Bar 53: bull breakout attempt above the range top, spiking from 2457.12 to 2680.00 but closing 2555.52 with a 124.48 upper tail. Bars 54-55 give no follow-through (2538.73, 2514.72) and price is later retraced to 2358.62, so this breakout is not accepted.", "end_time_ms": 1789142399999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": null, "start_time_ms": 1789128000000, "upper_boundary": "2680.00"}, {"description": "A higher high at 2609.02 (bar 73, above bar 72's 2544.63) is rejected by a bear bar closing 2514.07 near its low with a 94.95 upper tail. A lower high relative to 2680.00 plus the strong bear bar is an MTR-like top; bars 74-78 follow through to 2358.62.", "end_time_ms": 1789430399999, "kind": "mtr-like", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789416000000, "upper_boundary": "2609.02"}, {"description": "Bars 77-78: two large bear bars (ranges 2390.73-2484.35 and 2358.62-2442.15) breaking the 2411.04 range floor and printing the window low 2358.62.", "end_time_ms": 1789502399999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789473600000, "upper_boundary": null}, {"description": "Bull leg bars 94-115: spike to 2585.50 (bar 95), one pullback holding 2568.16 (bar 106), then a second push to 2850.00; higher highs and higher lows with closes accepted above the old range top 2680.00.", "end_time_ms": 1790035199999, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2486.12", "start_time_ms": 1789718400000, "upper_boundary": "2850.00"}, {"description": "Bars 113-119 post-spike consolidation: bars overlapping between 2716.01 (bar 117 low) and 2804.59 (bar 115 high); no bar exceeds the 2850.00 high and closes sit at 2723-2776.", "end_time_ms": 1790092799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2716.01", "start_time_ms": 1789992000000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: two consecutive closes above 2804.59 and then acceptance above 2850.00 confirm the spike as a trend leg and extend the bull channel.", "Failed breakout: a close back below 2658.06 (bar 112 low), followed by a close below 2609.02-2568.16, would show the 2850.00 spike failed and shift the read toward trading-range or transition-unclear.", "Pullback deepening: a close below 2716.01 (bar 117 low) that is not quickly reversed, especially a close below 2500.00, would break the 22-bar sequence of higher lows and flip Always-In.", "Range development: continued overlap inside 2716.01-2804.59 for roughly another 10 bars with shrinking ranges and no new high would change the phase from breakout-spike to a range/channel at the highs."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2448.74", "close_time_ms": 1789675199999, "high": "2454.03", "low": "2444.32", "open": "2451.55", "open_time_ms": 1789671600000, "volume": "1739963.044"}, {"close": "2451.99", "close_time_ms": 1789678799999, "high": "2457.42", "low": "2446.22", "open": "2448.74", "open_time_ms": 1789675200000, "volume": "1658669.559"}, {"close": "2447.45", "close_time_ms": 1789682399999, "high": "2454.68", "low": "2447.45", "open": "2451.99", "open_time_ms": 1789678800000, "volume": "1083818.438"}, {"close": "2443.75", "close_time_ms": 1789685999999, "high": "2447.45", "low": "2438.33", "open": "2447.45", "open_time_ms": 1789682400000, "volume": "1988637.215"}, {"close": "2446.22", "close_time_ms": 1789689599999, "high": "2449.2", "low": "2443.46", "open": "2443.75", "open_time_ms": 1789686000000, "volume": "1141302.393"}, {"close": "2446.89", "close_time_ms": 1789693199999, "high": "2446.89", "low": "2436.87", "open": "2446.22", "open_time_ms": 1789689600000, "volume": "2250317.206"}, {"close": "2457.2", "close_time_ms": 1789696799999, "high": "2458.47", "low": "2445.26", "open": "2446.89", "open_time_ms": 1789693200000, "volume": "1825586.474"}, {"close": "2463", "close_time_ms": 1789700399999, "high": "2465.17", "low": "2452.08", "open": "2457.85", "open_time_ms": 1789696800000, "volume": "1939084.233"}, {"close": "2476.78", "close_time_ms": 1789703999999, "high": "2482.09", "low": "2460.68", "open": "2463", "open_time_ms": 1789700400000, "volume": "2022411.123"}, {"close": "2480.3", "close_time_ms": 1789707599999, "high": "2480.35", "low": "2469.24", "open": "2476.75", "open_time_ms": 1789704000000, "volume": "2198637.447"}, {"close": "2477.97", "close_time_ms"